  inspectImage: {fileID: 0}
  noteContent: "I fire silver atoms through a magnet. Physics says I should get a
    blur. Instead, I get two sharp dots \u2014 up or down, nothing between. Those
    two dots prove the atom doesn't have a hidden spin before measurement. Each atom
    points every direction until I measure it."
